Completely resolution- and zoom-independent storage
Annotations survive page dimension changes (replaced page with same aspect → annotations stay aligned)
Portable to PDF spec annotations (PDF user-space coords = normX * mediaBox.width)
Rotation can be applied without mutation: displayRect = rotate(normRect, pageRotation, 1, 1) at render time, stored value is always upright
